"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T15:24:29-07:00","id":990664,"title":"","content":"At that's a better guess","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxrkv14ojD_TQXU0RBvF33Q\" target=\"_blank\">Fool's Corner Productions</a>: Where we review Video Game, and eventually tabletop RPGs<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/461-kingcarnival","name":"KingCarnival","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar461_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T15:54:04-07:00","id":990668,"title":"","content":"<i>N.B.: Not canon.</i><br /> <br /> CONFUCIUS<br /> What a relief that I have passed beyond mortal concerns. I wonder what kind of afterlife is in store for me. I never gave it much thought while I was alive.<br /> <br /> YELLOW EMPEROR<br /> Ah, Confucius! You've made it here at last. Welcome to Heaven!<br /> <br /> CONFUCIUS<br /> My thanks, Your Majesty! Happy to be here. Wait, did you say Heaven? Um \u2026 does all of Heaven look like this?<br /> <br /> YELLOW EMPEROR<br /> Oh, no, not at all. It looks a little more lived-in when you go outside the compound where we gods have our offices.<br /> <br /> CONFUCIUS<br /> So when you say &quot;we gods,&quot; do you mean\u2014<br /> <br /> YELLOW EMPEROR<br /> Oh, you know. Me, the Queen Mother of the West, F\u00fax\u012b, the rest of them \u2026 and now, you!<br /> <br /> CONFUCIUS<br /> Me.<br /> <br /> YELLOW EMPEROR<br /> Quite so.<br /> <br /> CONFUCIUS<br /> I'm. A god.<br /> <br /> YELLOW EMPEROR<br /> Congratulations.<br /> <br /> CONFUCIUS<br /> And this is my \u2026 office?<br /> <br /> YELLOW EMPEROR<br /> Exactly!<br /> <br /> CONFUCIUS<br /> What the hell? Also, why are the walls covered in pictures of me making a fool of myself? Why am I drowning in that one? That never happened!<br /> <br /> YELLOW EMPEROR<br /> You'll have to ask your friend about that. They volunteered to tidy up the place before you got here.<br /> <br /> CONFUCIUS<br /> Do you mean Y\u00e1n Hu\u00ed?<br /> <br /> YELLOW EMPEROR<br /> Don't think I know that name. No, your friend looks like a large number of grandmas who are constantly arguing with one another. Here they come now!<br /> <br /> CONFUCIUS<br /> Oh hell no.<br /> <br /> L\u01cdOZ\u01cf<br /> Heeeeeeeeeeey buddy! Now we get to hang out all the time!<br /> <br /> CONFUCIUS<br /> I'm in Hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new\"><a href=\"https://jamesmendezhodes.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mendez</span></a></span></div> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\"><b>Currently Developing</b> you know I should probably stop updating this field, I keep accidentally announcing things early<br /> <b>Crowdfund Me </b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mndz\" target=\"_blank\">via Patreon</a>: essays about race, religion, and culture in gaming</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":15}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8310-lula","name":"Lula","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8310_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},