"signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-29T16:08:02-07:00","id":995407,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElanConnor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=995377#post995377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Chapou.<br /> <br /> QUESTION: origin path, relationship path etcetc, a hero level must takes all of it or just the origin one? then at demigod he takes the second path and so on</div> </div> </div> </div>Paths are a core gameplay mechanic. Every character has three Paths at character creation and I don't believe that number ever changes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-29T18:37:57-07:00","id":995467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElanConnor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=995377#post995377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Chapou.<br /> <br /> QUESTION: origin path, relationship path etcetc, a hero level must takes all of it or just the origin one? then at demigod he takes the second path and so on</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paths</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Paths represent pieces of a series\u2019 setting that characters are part of and interact with. Paths are the pantheons characters belong to, the societies they join, the roles they play, the place they came from, or even a concept or setting topic that relates to them somehow. Paths can be setting-agnostic and setting-specific, and can be created before characters as a way to determine setting expectations and allow players to figure out what kinds of characters are best suited to the series. Each Path is a sentence or short phrase that indicates some important facet of your Scion, like \u201cBiggest Fish in the Smallest Pond,\u201d \u201cMagically Carved from a Living Ash Tree,\u201d or \u201cThe Bull of Wall Street.\u201d Paths are three direct, simple statements describing a character\u2019s ties to the World. They add Enhancements and dice rolls, but also establish allies, contacts, and relationships other characters don\u2019t have access to. They might also grant permission to take custom Knacks, Purviews, or other powers.<br /> <br /> <i>Choose three Paths for your character, relating to their origin, roles, and relationships. A character\u2019s Title (see Hero pg. XX), the sum of their deeds from their Legend, also functions as a Path but in an explicitly supernatural manner.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>From: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1TZpUdf6iL2co9aymT6J2BNVbTAYM67RcfigSj1xLU50/edit\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...gSj1xLU50/edit</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11726-solana","name":"Solana","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11726_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-29T21:49:30-07:00","id":995506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=994272#post994272\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No more than Thor can change his being doomed to die at Ragnarok.<br /> <br /> \u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>So...worth a try in other words?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/370-oriares","name":"Oriares","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar370_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-29T22:23:41-07:00",