um/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=997848#post997848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> An Elohim Scion who ascended in the Dark Ages, worshipped by small cults in the Late Medieval period?</div> </div> </div> </div>If Neall's still going with the Templars seeking to eliminate pantheistic worship, perhaps an emissary of Aten. Or a fiction created by the Templars' accusers which inadvertently concealed their Aten connection.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T16:24:26-07:00","id":997946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=997863#post997863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If Neall's still going with the Templars seeking to eliminate pantheistic worship, perhaps an emissary of Aten. Or a fiction created by the Templars' accusers which inadvertently concealed their Aten connection.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe he was a Knight Templer who had a huge crisis of faith when he discovered he was the Scion of Moloch?<br /> <br /> Regarding WicDiv, Neal has said it was a big inspiration on the 2nd edition, so much so that I think the Incarnate Scion origin was directly inspired by how Ananke &quot;activates&quot; new members of the Pantheon in the comic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11643-corax","name":"Corax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-04T05:09:52-07:00","id":998184,"title":"","content":"This has almost certainly already been asked and answered, in which case I'm sorry, but I remember hearing that the Orisha/Loa won't have a Titan. Who are they fighting, then?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12300-crying","name":"Crying","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12300_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-04T10:37:20-07:00","id":998302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crying</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=998184#post998184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This has almost certainly already been asked and answered, in which case I'm sorry, but I remember hearing that the Orisha/Loa won't have a Titan. Who are they fighting, then?</div> </div> </div> </div>2e isn't about fighting Titans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game design