a:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"338"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T16:10:51-08:00","id":1036891,"title":"","content":"I remember a post from Neall from a long time ago where he mentioned a pureview that was scary even though is sounded good. It was something like prosperity or fertility.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12483-ale137","name":"ale137","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T18:16:59-08:00","id":1036957,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ale137</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=1036891#post1036891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember a post from Neall from a long time ago where he mentioned a pureview that was scary even though is sounded good. It was something like prosperity or fertility.</div> </div> </div> </div>I remember in a Q&amp;A session I was at, where I asked Neall about the Fertility purview.<br /> <br /> He noted that a Fertility God could destroy your house with vines, kill your grandpa, and give you cancer. In like three seconds. They want Fertility to be legit badass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited"