ee society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T21:16:30-08:00","id":1049680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangle77</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=1049635#post1049635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does that mean it changes at Demigod and/or God?</div> </div> </div> </div>And building off this, for gods with more than one mantle, how freely can they change mantles? Can Mars decide in the heat of the moment to give in and become the more savage Ares and gain whatever bonuses would come along with that? or is it too involved to do on short notice?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8375-vonpenguin","name":"vonpenguin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T05:20:32-08:00","id":1049799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=1049599#post1049599\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Heroes can only use one PSP, full stop. You choose which mantle of the God is the character's parent.</div> </div> </div> </div>IIRC, writers have mentioned Yama only has the one Mantle, and is just worshipped as himself among different Pantheons. Does he have access to the Deva, Shen, and Kami PSPs? Or only Deva because of his origin (despite I assume being the recognized, paperwork filing Minister of Hell for the Celestial Bureaucracy)?<br /> <br /> If he has access to more than one PSP at his level of divinity, do his Scions just have to pick their Pantheon at the Hero level, setting PSP and Virtues?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T11:18:12-08:00","id":1049951,"title":"","content":"Besides Pantheons are their going to be any kind of powerful international organizations Scions can join like The Orders, The Covenants, Conspiracies in Chronicles of Darkness?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1675-weirdboyz","name":"Weirdboyz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1675_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T07:50:42-08:00","id":1050496,"title":"","content":"Sorry, I'm just adding to the list of questions, but how does having one of Beasts, Artistry, or Passion work when you want more than one but not all of them? like say you want Artistry (Storytelling and Playwriting) or Beast (Bunnies, Salmon, and Spiders)? how do the boons and previews work for that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T18:16:06-08:00","id":1050830,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SdeSpencer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=1050496#post1050496\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry, I'm just adding to the list of questions, but how does having one of Beasts, Artistry, or Passion work when you want more than one but not all of them? like say you want Artistry (Storytelling and Playwriting) or Beast (Bunnies, Salmon, and Spiders)? how do the boons and previews work for that?</div> </div> </div> </div>Artistry and Beast allow you to be a polymath artist or master of all animals, but picking a specific art or animal allows you to create a motif off that animal, through which you can channel other Purviews. PSPs and relics allow you to create motifs, through which you work marvels, the freeform expression of a Purview.<br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">\u00c6sir:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> By drawing runes or weaving threads, one may perform a jarteign.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Amatsukami:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> The kami are all things, and can be bidden to work wonders.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Dev\u00e1:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> By chanting spells and undergoing austerities, one may create or become a miracle.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Loa/Orisha:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> Those who understand plants can use them in magic and medicine.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Manitou:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> An offering of tobacco, prayers, dance and song convinces the myriad, unseen manitous to work their magic in your favor.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Netjer:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> Speaking the sacred ritual words releases sekhem, lending power to the soul.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Sh\u00e9n:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> Alchemy manipulates the energies both within and without the body through exercises and concoctions associated with the five elements.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Teotl: </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Offerings of flowers, food, effigies, and blood empower the gods to sustain the World with miracles. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Theoi:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> The most high may grant their favor to those who beseech them.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Tuatha de Danann:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> Magic flows from verse and satire.</span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T18:31:31-08:00","id":1050834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weirdboyz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=1049951#post1049951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Besides Pantheons are their going to be any kind of powerful international organizations Scions can join like The Orders, The Covenants, Conspiracies in Chronicles of Darkness?</div> </div> </div> </div>A few, yes. More to come in other supplements.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T18:39:39-08:00","id":1050836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/518351-ask-neall?p=1050834#post1050834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A few, yes. More to come in other supplements.</div> </div> </div> </div>As a sucker for factions in play, that's really really neat and I hope we can hear a teeny bit more about them someday. In-universe excuses for Scions of various Pantheons to band (ha!) together are always good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T18:45:09-08:00","id":1050837,"title":"","content":"I'm also a fan of factions in my RPGs, so I'm thrilled to hear they'll be included in 2E. This is just one more thing that I feel was really missing from 1E. I mean, I know 1E was a limited run, but it would've been nice to have more options for your Band to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">&quot;We have done the impossible, and that makes us mighty.&quot;<br /> Captain Malcolm Reynolds</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/679-unnatural1","name":"unnatural1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"