n b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They don't. Direct Prophecy isn't really the domain of the Gods; note that those two often tended to give the <i>gift </i>of prophecy to others, who then have the prophet path. Scions are ineligible for those Paths themselves. You can take Followers who have it, however.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking of followers,can supernatural beings like Fair Folk and Therianthropes scale up to hero or maybe demigod level?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T13:30:06-07:00","id":1128160,"title":"","content":"Huh. I wonder how that goes with the preview we just got that says Bast has the gift of prophecy <i>herself</i>, and the visions drain her and drive her to drink, thus being pretty important in the whole Bast/Sekhmet setup. It also explicitly says that her scions sometimes get a much less debilitating version of her prophetical ability. How is that mechanically represented if they can't have that Path?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0