d to play an Incarnate of.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, he could exist as a Mantle available to any Aesir via drinking the Mead of Poetry (a finite resource).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-25T22:44:46-07:00","id":1153067,"title":"","content":"Is this list of 27 (non-Pantheon-Specific) purviews accurate as to what's in Hero?<br /> <br /> Artistry (-)<br /> Beasts (-)<br /> Beauty<br /> Chaos<br /> Darkness<br /> Death<br /> Deception<br /> Earth<br /> Epic Dexterity<br /> Epic Stamina<br /> Epic Strength<br /> Fertility<br /> Fire<br /> Forge<br /> Fortune<br /> Health<br /> Journeys<br /> Moon<br /> Order<br /> Passion (-)<br /> Prosperity<br /> Sky<br /> Stars<br /> Sun<br /> War<br /> Water<br /> Wild<br /> <br /> [and then Frost in the Companion will bring the count to 28]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Jo